From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Stuart Fraser <60394096+stuart902@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 17:29:23 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: apple: t8010-j71b: Describe PMIC power-off

Connect the D2365 power-off child to the J71b Lightning supply. No other
board instantiates the new power-off device.

[Orchard: from stuart902/linux 778174c50d5fd6b36849f9eea728a6811b1b6e9e;
consolidated export, production source unchanged.]

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-j71b.dts | 7 +++++++
 1 file changed, 7 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-j71b.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-j71b.dts
index 9b87b385b..53f6eb630 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-j71b.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/apple/t8010-j71b.dts
@@ -84,3 +84,10 @@
 &nco {
 	status = "okay";
 };
+
+&d2365_pmic {
+	poweroff {
+		compatible = "apple,d2365-poweroff";
+		power-supplies = <&tristar_charger>;
+	};
+};
